SUMMARY:What is the first house or apartment you remember living in? Walk m
 e through the front door.
DESCRIPTION:Day 1 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What is the firs
 t house or apartment you remember living in? Walk me through the front doo
 r.\n\nThen: Which room did you spend the most time in\, and why that one?\
 n\nTip: Start with a place. Places are easier to describe than feelings\, 
 and the people show up on their own.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: 
 https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No 
 sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
