SUMMARY:Who lived on your street when you were small? Pick one neighbor you
  can still picture.
DESCRIPTION:Day 2 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Who lived on you
 r street when you were small? Pick one neighbor you can still picture.\n\n
 Then: What did that person do that you noticed as a kid?\n\nTip: If they n
 ame someone you have never heard of\, write the name down. It is a thread 
 for another day.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.pu
 retome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to
  unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
