DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261225
SUMMARY:What did a school day look like for you at about ten years old\, fr
 om the time you got up?
DESCRIPTION:Day 3 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What did a schoo
 l day look like for you at about ten years old\, from the time you got up?
 \n\nThen: How did you get to school\, and who went with you?\n\nTip: Ask f
 or the ordinary day\, not the big one. The ordinary day is the one nobody 
 wrote down.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.puretom
 e.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsu
 bscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
