UID:puretome-question-a-day-mom-or-dad-20261222-d04-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261225
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261226
SUMMARY:Which teacher or grown-up outside the family do you still think abo
 ut? Tell me about one day with them.
DESCRIPTION:Day 4 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Which teacher or
  grown-up outside the family do you still think about? Tell me about one d
 ay with them.\n\nThen: What is one thing they said that stuck with you?\n\
 nTip: Let them take their time. A pause usually means they are finding the
  picture.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.
 com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubs
 cribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
