UID:puretome-question-a-day-mom-or-dad-20261222-d05-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261226
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261227
SUMMARY:What was an ordinary weeknight supper where you grew up\, and who m
 ade it?
DESCRIPTION:Day 5 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What was an ordi
 nary weeknight supper where you grew up\, and who made it?\n\nThen: Which 
 dish from back then could you still make\, or still taste?\n\nTip: Food qu
 estions work at a busy table. Everyone has an opinion\, and the answers ar
 e funny more often than sad.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://
 questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\
 , nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
