DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261228
SUMMARY:What was your first paying job? Take me to the first day.
DESCRIPTION:Day 6 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What was your fi
 rst paying job? Take me to the first day.\n\nThen: What did you do with th
 e first money you earned?\n\nTip: Ask what the work smelled and sounded li
 ke. The senses bring back the details.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable
 : https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. N
 o sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
