SUMMARY:Find a photograph of yourself from when you were young. What was ha
 ppening just outside the frame?
DESCRIPTION:Day 7 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Find a photograp
 h of yourself from when you were young. What was happening just outside th
 e frame?\n\nThen: Who took it\, and what happened right after?\n\nTip: A p
 erson who cannot start a story can almost always explain a photo. Let the 
 picture do some of the asking.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https:
 //questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-u
 p\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
