DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261229
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261230
SUMMARY:Who was your closest friend when you were a teenager? Tell me about
  one afternoon you spent together.
DESCRIPTION:Day 8 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Who was your clo
 sest friend when you were a teenager? Tell me about one afternoon you spen
 t together.\n\nThen: Where did the two of you go when you wanted to get aw
 ay from everyone?\n\nTip: If the friend has died\, give it a moment before
  the next question. Then ask what they were like.\n\nAll thirty questions\
 , printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom 
 PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
