DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261230
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261231
SUMMARY:What song takes you straight back to a particular day when you were
  young? Where were you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 9 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What song takes 
 you straight back to a particular day when you were young? Where were you?
 \n\nThen: Who were you with when you heard it?\n\nTip: If you can\, play t
 he song for them. Then be quiet and let it work.\n\nAll thirty questions\,
  printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom P
 ureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
