DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
SUMMARY:What was the first place you lived on your own\, or away from the p
 eople who raised you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 10 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What was the fi
 rst place you lived on your own\, or away from the people who raised you?\
 n\nThen: What did it cost\, and what did you put in it?\n\nTip: Money deta
 ils are gold for a story. Ask for prices\, not just places.\n\nAll thirty 
 questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.htm
 l\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
