DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Tell me about a trip you still think about. Where did you go\, and 
 who was with you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 11 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a
  trip you still think about. Where did you go\, and who was with you?\n\nT
 hen: What went wrong on that trip?\n\nTip: Asking what went wrong usually 
 gets a better story than asking what was best.\n\nAll thirty questions\, p
 rintable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom Pur
 eTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
