DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270103
SUMMARY:What is a skill someone taught you by hand? Who taught you\, and wh
 ere were you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 12 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What is a skill
  someone taught you by hand? Who taught you\, and where were you?\n\nThen:
  What did they do differently from how people do it now?\n\nTip: If it is 
 something they can show you\, ask them to show you. Hands remember.\n\nAll
  thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or
 -dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
