DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270103
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270104
SUMMARY:Tell me about a holiday from when you were young that you remember 
 clearly\, good or not. Where was it?
DESCRIPTION:Day 13 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a
  holiday from when you were young that you remember clearly\, good or not.
  Where was it?\n\nThen: Who was there\, and who sat where?\n\nTip: Some ho
 lidays were hard. If the answer turns heavy\, follow it gently or move on.
  Both are fine.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.pur
 etome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to 
 unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
