SUMMARY:Where were you when you heard a piece of big news\, the kind everyo
 ne remembers?
DESCRIPTION:Day 14 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Where were you 
 when you heard a piece of big news\, the kind everyone remembers?\n\nThen:
  Who was the first person you talked to about it?\n\nTip: News days are ea
 sy to place in time\, which helps you put the rest of the story in order l
 ater.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/
 print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscrib
 e from.
