DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270106
SUMMARY:What is a job or a role you were proud of\, paid or not? Tell me ab
 out one day of it.
DESCRIPTION:Day 15 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What is a job o
 r a role you were proud of\, paid or not? Tell me about one day of it.\n\n
 Then: Who did you work alongside\, and what were they like?\n\nTip: Halfwa
 y. Read back one answer from the first two weeks and ask if you got it rig
 ht. The corrections are often the best part.\n\nAll thirty questions\, pri
 ntable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureT
 ome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
