DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270107
SUMMARY:What is the hardest physical work you have ever done? Where were yo
 u?
DESCRIPTION:Day 16 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What is the har
 dest physical work you have ever done? Where were you?\n\nThen: How did yo
 u feel at the end of that day?\n\nTip: When a line lands\, write down thei
 r exact words. Your summary will never be as good as how they said it.\n\n
 All thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom
 -or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
