DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270108
SUMMARY:Tell me about a time you got lost\, stuck or stranded somewhere. Ho
 w did you get home?
DESCRIPTION:Day 17 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a
  time you got lost\, stuck or stranded somewhere. How did you get home?\n\
 nThen: Who helped\, or who should have?\n\nTip: Small emergencies make goo
 d stories\, and they are usually safe to tell at the table.\n\nAll thirty 
 questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.htm
 l\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
