DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270109
SUMMARY:Who made you laugh the most when you were growing up? Tell me about
  one time.
DESCRIPTION:Day 18 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Who made you la
 ugh the most when you were growing up? Tell me about one time.\n\nThen: Wh
 at would they say if they walked in right now?\n\nTip: Ask for an impressi
 on. People will often do a voice they have not done in years.\n\nAll thirt
 y questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.h
 tml\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
