DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270110
SUMMARY:What drive\, bus ride or train route do you remember best? Where di
 d it take you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 19 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What drive\, bu
 s ride or train route do you remember best? Where did it take you?\n\nThen
 : What did you see out the window?\n\nTip: A trip gives a story a beginnin
 g\, a middle and an end without anyone trying.\n\nAll thirty questions\, p
 rintable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom Pur
 eTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
