DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270111
SUMMARY:Tell me about a decision that changed where your life went. Where w
 ere you when you made it?
DESCRIPTION:Day 20 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a
  decision that changed where your life went. Where were you when you made 
 it?\n\nThen: Who did you tell first?\n\nTip: Do not ask whether it was the
  right call. Ask what it was like to make it.\n\nAll thirty questions\, pr
 intable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom Pure
 Tome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html
