DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270112
SUMMARY:Where did you go to be alone\, or to think\, when you were younger?
  Describe it.
DESCRIPTION:Day 21 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Where did you g
 o to be alone\, or to think\, when you were younger? Describe it.\n\nThen:
  What did you think about there?\n\nTip: If they say nowhere\, ask where t
 hey went when the house got loud.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: htt
 ps://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sig
 n-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
