DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270113
SUMMARY:Tell me about someone you lost touch with that you still wonder abo
 ut.
DESCRIPTION:Day 22 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about s
 omeone you lost touch with that you still wonder about.\n\nThen: Where did
  you last see them?\n\nTip: Write down every name you hear today. A list o
 f names is worth a second conversation.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printabl
 e: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. 
 No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
