SUMMARY:What did a Saturday look like for you in your twenties or thirties?
  Pick one you remember.
DESCRIPTION:Day 23 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What did a Satu
 rday look like for you in your twenties or thirties? Pick one you remember
 .\n\nThen: Where did the money go back then\, and where did the time go?\n
 \nTip: Decades are easier to walk through than single years. Let them pick
  the decade.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.pureto
 me.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to uns
 ubscribe from.
