SUMMARY:What is something you made\, built\, grew or fixed that you are pro
 ud of? Tell me about making it.
DESCRIPTION:Day 24 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: What is somethi
 ng you made\, built\, grew or fixed that you are proud of? Tell me about m
 aking it.\n\nThen: Where is it now?\n\nTip: Pride is an easier door than r
 egret. Go in through it first.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https:
 //questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-u
