SUMMARY:Tell me about a meal you will never forget. Where were you\, and wh
 o was at the table?
DESCRIPTION:Day 25 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a
  meal you will never forget. Where were you\, and who was at the table?\n\
 nThen: What was said at that table that you still remember?\n\nTip: At a f
 amily meal\, ask while the plates are mostly empty and nobody has stood up
  yet.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/
 print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscrib
