SUMMARY:Of the people who raised you\, who do you think about most? Tell me
  about one ordinary day with them.
DESCRIPTION:Day 26 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Of the people w
 ho raised you\, who do you think about most? Tell me about one ordinary da
 y with them.\n\nThen: What do you wish you had asked them?\n\nTip: This qu
 estion often turns the conversation around. Let it.\n\nAll thirty question
 s\, printable: https://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFro
 m PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
