SUMMARY:Tell me about a year that was hard\, and one small thing that got y
 ou through it.
DESCRIPTION:Day 28 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: Tell me about a
  year that was hard\, and one small thing that got you through it.\n\nThen
 : Who showed up for you that year?\n\nTip: Only if they want to. "I don't 
 want to get into that" is a full answer. Say "that's fine" and ask about t
 he small thing instead.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://quest
 ions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, not
