SUMMARY:If you could go back to one place from your life tomorrow\, where w
 ould it be? What would you do first when you got there?
DESCRIPTION:Day 29 of 30\, 30 days with Mom or Dad.\n\nAsk: If you could go
  back to one place from your life tomorrow\, where would it be? What would
  you do first when you got there?\n\nThen: Who would you want with you?\n\
 nTip: If a small version of this trip is possible\, even a drive past an o
 ld address\, write that down too.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: htt
 ps://questions.puretome.com/print/mom-or-dad.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sig
 n-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
